id: SEC-036
title: Missing rate limiting on auth endpoints (OWASP API4)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .js .ts
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: (?:app|router)\.post\(['"].*(?:login|signin|auth|password|reset|register|otp|verify)['"]
    message: "Auth endpoint without visible rate limiting — brute-force, credential stuffing, and OTP abuse risk"
fix: Add rate limiting middleware (express-rate-limit, rate-limiter-flexible) to auth endpoints.